# ⛔ The playground's module is BUILT, never committed. It is six megabytes
# compressed, it would land in every clone and in every diff, and a committed
# copy goes stale against the libraries it was built from with nothing to say
# so. The deploy workflow builds it in the same job that publishes the page,
# which is what keeps the two in step.
/static/playground/playground.wasm
/static/playground/wasm_exec.js
